OL,3,GNEWSAChief constable agrees to stay for
OL,4,Atwo more years
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevon and Cornwall Police's chief
OL,7,Fconstable has agreed to stay in the job
OL,8,Ffor two more years.
OL,10,FThe force's Police and Crime
OL,11,FCommissioner Alison Hernandez confirmed
OL,12,FJames Vaughan had extended his contract
OL,13,Funtil August 2028.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
