OL,3,GNEWSAChief constable agrees to stay for
OL,4,Atwo more years
OL,5,
OL,6,FVaughan was appointed on an interim
OL,7,Fbasis in December 2024 following the
OL,8,Fsuspension of the then Acting Chief
OL,9,FConstable Jim Colwell, who later
OL,10,Freceived a written warning from the
OL,11,Fpolice watchdog for breaching the
OL,12,Fforce's notifiable associations policy
OL,13,Fbut was cleared of gross misconduct
OL,14,Fallegations.
OL,16,FIt means Vaughan is set to remain in
OL,17,Fpost beyond the government's plans to
OL,18,Fabolish the police and crime
OL,19,Fcommissioner's role in May 2028.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
